        "title": "不 / 白: 不X白不X argues there is no reason to miss an opportunity",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "不X白不X argues that an available opportunity should not be missed. It is a persuasive stance, not cancellation of two negatives.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "不吃白不吃。",
                "pinyin": "bù chī bái bù chī 。",
                "meaning": "You might as well eat while the chance is there.",
                "audio": "3f4016580dbf5e785765f560f9098683ac5c5f177cd5e9399ef55f8c62666175"
              },
              {
                "text": "不看白不看。",
                "pinyin": "bù kàn bái bù kàn 。",
                "meaning": "You might as well take a look while you can.",
                "audio": "45036295bf9493787e048815ee55e2b52c319ee72de3d10cc56c6f09dc9d49b5"
              }
